# POLLY, the help cards: every button held alone a second on every kind of page (Home, Song, Progression, Band,
# Notes, Sound, Mixer, Effects, Style, Setup; then with the melody M1 selected: Sound, Band, Notes), so the simulator's
# check (a card's words past its box fail) covers every card's words. PLAY's card: held on Home and on Song (PLAY
# starts on its press: tapped again to stop). Card = the button's number + 1 (FX 1 .. OCT+ 14).
# On Notes, SEQ stays lit (its page).
